germany: Zensus 2022 table 1000A-1018, cut by GEORB1 (regierungsbezirk)
germany: 1000A-1018 answered HTTP 400 Bad Request. A 401 here means the account was not accepted -- this API reads the credential from the request headers and ignores it as a query parameter, so a working account presented the wrong way looks exactly like a rejected one.
